    "chunk_text": "te\u00f0 \u00e6lcne mannan \u00f0e in middangeard & eall mancynn he gebyrhte\u00f0 & inlihte\u00f0 mid his \u00ferymmes mihte & mid his wuldre. For \u00fean englas hine heredon & wuldredon & him lof s\u00e6gdon \u00e6t his acennesse & \u00f0us cw\u00e6don: Wuldor \u00dea cyrdon \u00fea englas to ure sybbe & to ure lufan, \u00fea hie gesegon & ongeaton \u00f0\u00e6t dryhten Crist w\u00e6s \u00deonne, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00feeah is swi\u00f0e mycel nyd\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we us in \u00e6ghwylce tide beon wi\u00f0 synnum Ac \u00e6ghwylc man hine sylfne healde & cl\u00e6nsie in rihtwisnesse & in cl\u00e6nnesse his lifes, \u00fea lytlan Ac utan we nu for \u00fean, bro\u00f0or mine, herian we urne dryhten h\u00e6lende Crist & hine wuldrian & Don we him symle \u00feancas of urum spedum, for \u00fean \u00fee he us ontynde heofona rices duru \u00feurh his \u00fea Biddan we nu urne dryhten \u00e6lmihtigne & sancta Marian \u00fe\u00e6t he us forgife for his mildheortnesse & for & we \u00fe\u00e6r habba\u00f0 a so\u00f0e sybbe & so\u00f0e lufan in ecnesse & so\u00f0ne gefean & ecne eard & ece wuldor.",
